url: "https://github.com/ArleneHarrison/fail-closed-eqtl-gwas-integration"
abstract: >-
  An executable, auditable fail-closed contract for regional eQTL–GWAS
  integration, accompanied by synthetic verification, multi-signal
  robustness experiments, signed-LD graph anomaly triage, and a frozen
  multi-tissue technical evaluation in coronary artery disease and heart
  failure. The release supports claims about workflow reliability and
  failure handling; it does not assert new biological or clinical findings.
